  "body": "A fantastic opportunity to secure a brand-new home in one of Orewa’s most desirable new developments. This property offers modern design, low-maintenance living, and strong long-term appeal — making it an excellent choice for first-home buyers, downsizers, and investors seeking a reliable rental option.\r\nCompletion time will be discussed and confirmed upon executing the contract.\r\nKey Features\r\n• 3 double bedrooms, including master with ensuite\r\n• 2 stylish bathrooms with quality fittings\r\n• Open-plan living and dining with seamless indoor–outdoor flow\r\n• Modern kitchen with quality appliances\r\n• Positioned in a well-planned, landscaped development with a family-friendly feel\r\nPrime Orewa Location\r\nEnjoy the best of coastal and urban convenience:\r\n• Minutes to Orewa Beach and the stunning coastal walkway\r\n• Close to Orewa town center, supermarkets, shops, and cafés\r\n• Easy access to State Highway 1, making commuting simple\r\n• Nearby schools, parks, and recreational facilities\r\nThis location is highly sought-after for both homeowners and tenants, adding to its investment appeal.\r\nBuy Now & Save – Progress Payments Option\r\nSave thousands by purchasing early and making progress payments throughout the build.\r\nFixed Price – Limited Availability\r\nBenefit from the certainty of a fixed-price contract with no hidden surprises.\r\nWith only a limited number of packages available, opportunities like this are rarely available for long.\r\nEnquire today — high-demand Orewa packages are snapped up quickly.",
